Testigo: {
	Ambiente1: I watched you before you had a name.
	Ambiente2: The book you carry… I saw the first one being born.
	Ambiente3: Every bearer ends up as a page. Yours is still being written.

	Chat: {
		SinLibro: I have watched you. You have not yet claimed the Genesis Shard. Look for the Hollow Sanctum underground.
		Debil: Your shard glows at level {0}. Still weak. Keep fighting.
		Recuerda: Level {0}… The shard begins to remember its origin. The Starlight Rain approaches.
		Sagrario: Level {0}. The Hollow Sanctum answers your power. Dimensional rifts lurk.
		Ecos: Level {0}. Aethon stirs in his dreams. The Echoes of former bearers will come for you.
		Despierta: Level {0}. Aethon is about to wake. Prepare for the acknowledgment.
		Espera: Level {0}. Aethon awaits you. Go to the Hollow Sanctum and call his name.
	}

	BotonResonancia: Buy Resonance (10 coins)
	BotonEsencias: Wardens' Essences
	EsenciasBloqueadas: The Witness keeps the drawer shut: essences belong only to those who SURVIVED wave 10 of the fury.
	ResonanciaEntregada: The Witness hands you a Resonance Shard.
	ResonanciaBloqueada: The Witness only shares resonance with bearers of level 50+.

	Cronica: {
		KingSlime: Chronicle of King Slime: he rolled after his crown until the very end. Nobody told him crowns are not food.
		EyeofCthulhu: Chronicle of the Eye: it closed its lid one last time. I saw what it watched — it watched YOU.
		Deerclops: Chronicle of Deerclops: the walking winter knelt. Beneath its breath there was frost… and relief.
		QueenBee: Chronicle of the Queen: she shed her stinger and with it the whole hive. Royal honey tastes of farewell.
		EaterofWorlds: Chronicle of the Eater: every segment died believing it was the head. The book thought the same.
		BrainofCthulhu: Chronicle of the Brain: its reflections screamed red as it fell. The echo outlived it.
		Skeletron: Chronicle of Skeletron: the curse released him at last. He spoke your name with the Old Man's mouth.
		WallofFlesh: Chronicle of the Wall: the night of hunger that opened hardmode. The book does not tell doors from food.
		QueenSlime: Chronicle of Queen Slime: the sugar melted in the rain. She hopped to the end — she liked to play.
		Twins: Chronicle of the Twins: they fell watching each other. Two eyes, a single defeat.
		Destroyer: Chronicle of the Destroyer: the machine came apart in a spiral. Its drones kept firing a while — loyalty cannot read life.
		SkeletronPrime: Chronicle of Prime: the four arms fell each on its own side. The head took its time accepting it.
		Plantera: Chronicle of Plantera: the jungle went silent. Bulbs that never opened.
		Golem: Chronicle of the Golem: the temple lost its guardian. His fists finally rested.
		DukeFishron: Chronicle of the Duke: the pig-fish fell with honor intact. He asked for a clean fight and got it.
		EmpressOfLight: Chronicle of the Empress: light bowed before light. Elegant even in death.
		LunaticCultist: Chronicle of the Cultist: the ritual stayed half-done. He thought he summoned the Moon; he summoned his end.
		MoonLord: Chronicle of the Moon Lord: three eyes and a core, all closing at once. I was there — nobody else saw him whole.
		Aethon: Chronicle of Aethon: the Primordial Light went out ACKNOWLEDGING you. I saw his first light being born — it honors me to have seen his last.
		HollowTitan: Chronicle of the Titan: the colossus crumbled into the Sanctum's crystal. He was the oldest guardian… and the first to fall.
		RiftKeeper: Chronicle of the Keeper: he withdrew through his own tear. He chose the void over the page.
		LosEcos: Chronicle of the Echoes: the Archer and the Bearer went out together. They were people, you know? Before the first book.
		Desconocido: Nameless chronicle: something died and the book ate it. I saw it… but my pages do not remember it.
	}
}

Conditions.TiendaEsencias: Survive wave 10 of the grimoire's fury

Jefe: {
	Resonancia: You absorbed {1} resonance shards from {0}!
	Titan.Furia: THE HOLLOW TITAN DOUBLES DOWN — the crystal crackles with fury. The choir comes in fast mode.

	Rift: {
		Sello: THE KEEPER SEALS THE RIFTS — the between-worlds closes around you.
		Paredes: The TEAR WALLS advance — the arena is narrowing.
	}

	Arquera: {
		Furia: THE ARCHER DOES NOT FORGET — the bow draws double and the mines rain down.
		Lluvia: The Archer calls the STARFALL — watch the ground markers.
	}

	Portador.Furia: THE FIRST BEARER UNSHEATHES REALITY — his weapon is no longer just the blade.

	Aethon: {
		Fase: Aethon — PHASE {0}: {1}
		Nombre1: The Stardust
		Nombre2: The Nebula
		Nombre3: The Gravity
		Nombre4: The Black Hole
		Nombre5: The Acknowledgment
		Gravedad: Aethon bends gravity — THE FLOOR IS NO LONGER YOURS!
		Recordar: AETHON REMEMBERS — the runes he memorized from you return to their owner.
		Reconocimiento: Aethon acknowledges you as an equal. THE ASCENDED FORM falls at your feet.
		Presentacion: The earth trembles. THE BONE SERPENT OF THE LIGHT rises from below — its tail entangles the horizon.
		Muerte: The serpent comes apart. The Primordial Light escapes its bones.
	}
}

Esencia: {
	SinLibro: The soul looks for an Eternal Grimoire in your hotbar — the book is the one who tastes it.
	Sabor1: A whole soul… it tastes of victory and distant sulfur.
	Sabor2: The warden's soul goes down clean — one more level on the spine.
	Sabor3: Warden digested. His story is my page now.
	CofreSeco: "{0}'s chest of souls is DRY in this world — ten pages, story closed."
	UltimaAlma: "{0}'s LAST soul fell. Its story in this world is complete."
}

